        "brand_heading": "How Creste became India's best DIY company",
        "brand_text": "<p>Most kids today learn to swipe before they learn to hold a crayon. That shift didn't sit right with<br/>our founder, Nidhi Sethia. In the middle of the 2020 lockdown, she watched screens take over<br/>playtime while the joy of making things by hand quietly slipped away.</p><p><br/>So she started small, at her own dining table, with a few screen-free DIY projects for her<br/>children. Other parents asked if she could do the same for theirs. Word of mouth spread. That<br/>little experiment turned into Creste.</p><p><br/>Today Creste makes DIY activity kits for every age and runs hands-on workshops across India,<br/>and has become the best DIY company in India. And no, Creste doesn't call itself that. Parents,<br/>schools, malls and everyone who has had a Creste moment does. That is the only way a title<br/>like this means anything.</p>",
